		"description": "<p>Pulsers are high-intensity laser weapons, projecting an intense, brief laser pulse at the target. Hunting Pulsers are a variant designed for use at longer ranges, able to adjust the focal length of the pulse to a few hundred meters. They’re useful for hunting game, but also for precision attacks.</p><p>The profile for the Hunting Pulser can be found in the Security Weapons Table at the start of this section. A Hunting Pulser is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Break rest.</p>",
